{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tmGNeCqyAp1795182314.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本多地出現大風雪，當局提醒民眾注意。</p><p></p><p>日本氣象廳稱，受到高空冷空氣影響，大氣極不穩定的狀態持續，北海道和北陸地區要嚴防強風，北日本至西日本地區，都可能出現龍捲風和暴雨，山區預計會有積雪。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.WEATHER-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JfqX4XFNS71795182334.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>當局呼籲民眾留意路面結冰，對交通造成影響，北陸地區要嚴防山泥傾瀉。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.WEATHER-2300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RgJmYwEy4w1795182347.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:03:55.735544+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T13:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T15:57:10.932473+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T14:57:18.914023+00:00","content_hash":"d4773f0c486941c79f6bbc3edd0cfa03e4c2ee576bed85ce8f0325ab39d8bf08","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:03:55.735544+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}